  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training and Technical Assistance and Comprehensive Support for Countries Launching or Operational National Human Trafficking Hotlines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Polaris Project will provide training and technical assistance (T&amp;TA) to 10-15 countries (TBD) in developing or enhancing existing anti-human trafficking hotlines. It will also map out and conduct a landscape analysis of anti-trafficking hotlines globally, develop a suite of training tools on how to develop and operate a hotline, and design a country specific assessment tool to determine what countries will be selected for targeted T&amp;TA efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
